The offline history catalog contains reviewed class metadata derived from public
Android SDK signatures at platform/prebuilts/sdk commit
3af7c93524be6f51e092b87b17f009f13ee98b43. Complete SDK binaries and signature files
are not bundled in the app. The original repository NOTICE is retained as
licenses/android-sdk-NOTICE.txt. It contains SDK terms, not an Apache declaration.

The historical resource exporter analyzes Android Open Source Project framework
sources. The reviewed KitKat framework commit is
63ade05d76785975fc3292ca030abbaa1dda8891. Its root module declares Apache 2.0.
The original root NOTICE is retained as licenses/aosp-frameworks-base-NOTICE.txt,
including its additional third-party attributions. The full Apache 2.0 license
is in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Framework resource exports include notices from
their actual release commits; the bundled KitKat notice does not replace those.

Original historical resources and captures are not bundled in this app. Current
platform samples use widgets from the installed Android OS. Library samples use
the explicitly recorded Compose Material library versions. Source analysis does
not establish original historical OS appearance or behavior.

Original notice URLs, immutable commits, and byte hashes are in
licenses/provenance.json. These attribution files do not change upstream terms
or assign a single license to every AOSP or SDK file.
